{
  "_comment": [
    "Content icons for Good Footing: one concept (meaning) -> one glyph -> one asset. Read by tools/art/build_icons.py.",
    "source 'phosphor': Phosphor Bold (+ Fill twin for the selected state) from the pinned npm tarball below.",
    "source 'custom': assets/icons/custom/<glyph>.svg and <glyph>-fill.svg (drawn by tools/art/draw_custom_icons.py).",
    "layers ['base','mark']: two-tone custom icon. Extra assets <asset>-base, <asset>-base-fill (selected) and <asset>-mark; show with LayeredIcon (base = ink ~55 %, mark = sienna). <asset>/<asset>-fill stay as single-colour fallbacks.",
    "tint = colour role (sap/sky/ochre/sienna/danger) per icon-va-chong-nham-chan.md; glyph colour tokens come in milestone 3.",
    "replaces = the SF Symbol this concept replaces in the views. System controls (chevron, checkmark, xmark, plus, play/pause) stay SF Symbols.",
    "sharedGlyphs: the only glyphs allowed on more than one concept (one symbol, one meaning). Empty on purpose."
  ],
